The {{Term/Store|Gerudo Outfit|Gerudo Outfits|Series, BotW}},<ref name="BotW Vilia"/> also known as the '''Gerudo Clothes''',<ref name="BotW Robsten"/> is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}. The Gerudo Outfit goes unnamed in {{AoC}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Gerudo Outfit is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Gerudo Veil]], [[Gerudo Top]], and [[Gerudo Sirwal]]. The set can be purchased from [[Vilia]] on top of the [[Kara Kara Bazaar]] for 600 [[Rupee]]s as part of the "[[Forbidden City Entry]]" [[Main Quest]]. Afterwards, all three pieces can be bought in [[Gerudo Town]] for 540 [[Rupee]]s total. Wearing the set provides [[Link]] with level 1 heat resistance and a total of 3 defense. In addition, wearing the set will disguise [[Link]] as a woman and allow him entry into [[Gerudo Town]]. It cannot be [[Enhancing|Enhance]]d.

